# Claude Code worktrees — local scratch, never part of the repo.
.claude/
# Git worktrees checked out inside the repo. A worktree's root is a FILE holding
# a gitdir pointer, not a directory git recurses into, so the rule above does
# not cover it and a plain `git add -A` sweeps it in as a one-line embedded
# repository — committing a path that means nothing on any other clone.
.worktrees/
